  "prefLabel": "Ins 3509.04 Minimum Valuation Mortality Standards",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 3509.04 Minimum Valuation Mortality Standards. For preneed insurance contracts as defined in Ins 3905.03 (c), and similar policies and contracts, the minimum mortality standard for determining reserve liabilities and non-forfeiture values for both male and female insureds shall be the Ultimate 1980 CSO.\n\nSource. #9245, eff 9-2-08; ss by #11148, eff 9-2-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins3500.html"
